OL,3,GNEWSATrust leaves maternity support
OL,4,Ascheme after improvements
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaternity and neonatal services at a
OL,7,Fhospital trust have exited a national
OL,8,Fimprovement programme after "sustained
OL,9,Fimprovements" in safety and care.
OL,11,FUniversity Hospitals of Morecambe Bay
OL,12,FNHS Foundation Trust (UHMBT) had been
OL,13,Fpart of the scheme since 2021, when
OL,14,Fmaternity services were rated by
OL,15,Finspectors as "inadequate".
OL,17,FThe trust has maternity units at
OL,18,FFurness General Hospital, Barrow, and
OL,19,FWestmorland General Hospital in Kendal
OL,20,Fin Cumbria, as well as the Royal
OL,21,FLancaster Infirmary in Lancashire.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
